 ◆ marion  ~/code/acme-api                           Start   Watch   Setup   ?
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  WATCH                                  START
  j/k    move                            enter  run
  enter  its stream full-screen; a pan…  ↑↓     harness
  esc    back from the stream            ←→     model
  s      steer                           ^o     read-only flavour
  x      cancel, asks first              ^p     headless or pane
  u      resume an ended node            esc    clear the prompt
  o      shell in its workspace          SETUP
  d      what its branch changed         enter  expand
  c      copy the merge                  r      re-check
  !      next that needs you             e      edit agent types
  J/K    scroll its stream               n      new agent type, previewed
  EVERYWHERE                             a      add a provider key
  tab    next screen                     x      remove a key, asks first
  ?      help (Start: empty prompt)      a      on Profiles: add one
  ↓ 3 below  j/k scroll

